/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 57 0 R
/T (This case study demonstrates that building a full stack web application involves more than creating a user interface: the key is connecting user actions, application data, state and UI updates into one complete and working flow. The College Bus Tracking & Pass Management System demonstrates this approach at prototype level: React state manages changing bus and pass information, the Fetch API separates data from the interface, and JavaScript handles validation, filtering and application logic. The current system is primarily a frontend prototype using simulated JSON data.)
/E (This case study demonstrates that building a full stack web application involves more than creating a user interface: the key is connecting user actions, application data, state and UI updates into one complete and working flow. The College Bus Tracking & Pass Management System demonstrates this approach at prototype level: React state manages changing bus and pass information, the Fetch API separates data from the interface, and JavaScript handles validation, filtering and application logic. The current system is primarily a frontend prototype using simulated JSON data.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
